  { problem: "Sales says the leads from LinkedIn are not qualified", solution: "This usually means the Lead Gen Form or targeting is too loose. We tighten job title and company filters and add qualifying questions directly into the form to pre-screen leads before they reach sales." },
  { problem: "We tried LinkedIn Ads ourselves and burned budget fast", solution: "Self-managed LinkedIn campaigns often default to broad audience expansion, which drains budget on irrelevant profiles. Expert account-based targeting keeps spend focused on your actual buyer." },
];

