  { q: "Is LinkedIn Ads worth it for a small or mid-size company?", a: "Yes, if your buyer is a business decision-maker rather than a consumer. IT services, SaaS, consulting, manufacturing, and B2B companies in GIFT City and across Ahmedabad see strong results because LinkedIn lets you target by exact job title and company size." },
  { q: "How long before LinkedIn Ads start producing leads?", a: "Sponsored Content campaigns typically start generating impressions and clicks within 24 to 48 hours. B2B sales cycles are longer than consumer purchases, so we track both immediate Lead Gen Form submissions and longer-term engagement from target accounts." },
